</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 843)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Review Manager: a live review&#8217;s row has <b>Copy Passphrase</b> beside Copy Link &#8212; the four words you need mid-call. <b>End All Live Reviews</b> asks once before it ends them.</li>
<li>Asobi now keeps three private counts on this Mac &#8212; whether Options gets opened, and whether Join a Review is reached from the menu or the lock screen &#8212; so the next pass over these windows starts from evidence. Nothing leaves the machine.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
